  "what_this_is": "A surrogate for the four-point margin's null floor, fitted to `reticulation null-sweep`. Only the floor is predicted; the certificate's margin stays an exact integer comparison, so a wrong surrogate costs power or wastes a query and cannot make a certificate wrong.",
